{"3497690": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Mole Mayhem", "steam_appid": 3497690, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497690/extras/fa5019ee753888175c5990089bb3cc70.poster.avif?t=1757634342\" width=800 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497690/extras/fa5019ee753888175c5990089bb3cc70.webm?t=1757634342\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497690/extras/fa5019ee753888175c5990089bb3cc70.mp4?t=1757634342\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Moles Mayhem</strong>, players take control of mining moles and enter a chaotic free-for-all battle where the goal is to <strong>poke</strong> your opponents (or friends) until victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Poke or Be Poked</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497690/extras/0958e4af297b0c94a7be228d188eb5fa.poster.avif?t=1757634342\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497690/extras/0958e4af297b0c94a7be228d188eb5fa.webm?t=1757634342\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497690/extras/0958e4af297b0c94a7be228d188eb5fa.mp4?t=1757634342\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use speed boosts to enhance your movement and gain the upper hand!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch out for the holes scattered around the map – one slip, and you’re history.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collide head-on? The drills will repel each other, and we can’t guarantee what will happen next...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose Your Mole</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497690/extras/3c688986a46f55bc685ec478a7a9bdd1.poster.avif?t=1757634342\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497690/extras/3c688986a46f55bc685ec478a7a9bdd1.webm?t=1757634342\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497690/extras/3c688986a46f55bc685ec478a7a9bdd1.mp4?t=1757634342\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as different moles like <strong>Grandma Mole</strong>, <strong>Mr. &quot;Miner&quot; Mole</strong>, a dynamic father-daughter duo, or be <strong>Moley &quot;The Excavator&quot;</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Throw Your Friends into the Hole!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497690/extras/b321a3fedb98af0120a3407bc38df9d5.poster.avif?t=1757634342\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497690/extras/b321a3fedb98af0120a3407bc38df9d5.webm?t=1757634342\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497690/extras/b321a3fedb98af0120a3407bc38df9d5.mp4?t=1757634342\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New maps, characters, and mechanics coming on the track!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The next match will always be the most chaotic one!</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497690/extras/fa5019ee753888175c5990089bb3cc70.poster.avif?t=1757634342\" width=800 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497690/extras/fa5019ee753888175c5990089bb3cc70.webm?t=1757634342\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497690/extras/fa5019ee753888175c5990089bb3cc70.mp4?t=1757634342\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Moles Mayhem</strong>, players take control of mining moles and enter a chaotic free-for-all battle where the goal is to <strong>poke</strong> your opponents (or friends) until victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Poke or Be Poked</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497690/extras/0958e4af297b0c94a7be228d188eb5fa.poster.avif?t=1757634342\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497690/extras/0958e4af297b0c94a7be228d188eb5fa.webm?t=1757634342\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497690/extras/0958e4af297b0c94a7be228d188eb5fa.mp4?t=1757634342\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use speed boosts to enhance your movement and gain the upper hand!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch out for the holes scattered around the map – one slip, and you’re history.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collide head-on? The drills will repel each other, and we can’t guarantee what will happen next...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose Your Mole</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497690/extras/3c688986a46f55bc685ec478a7a9bdd1.poster.avif?t=1757634342\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497690/extras/3c688986a46f55bc685ec478a7a9bdd1.webm?t=1757634342\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497690/extras/3c688986a46f55bc685ec478a7a9bdd1.mp4?t=1757634342\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as different moles like <strong>Grandma Mole</strong>, <strong>Mr. &quot;Miner&quot; Mole</strong>, a dynamic father-daughter duo, or be <strong>Moley &quot;The Excavator&quot;</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Throw Your Friends into the Hole!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497690/extras/b321a3fedb98af0120a3407bc38df9d5.poster.avif?t=1757634342\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497690/extras/b321a3fedb98af0120a3407bc38df9d5.webm?t=1757634342\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497690/extras/b321a3fedb98af0120a3407bc38df9d5.mp4?t=1757634342\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New maps, characters, and mechanics coming on the track!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The next match will always be the most chaotic one!</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Get into the giant drill tank, mole! Enter chaotic arenas with up to 4 players in a free-for-all, where the mission is to poke your opponents with your drill! Use speed boosts to escape or chase, avoid tricky holes, and get ready to poke your way to victory!", "supported_languages": "English, Spanish - Spain, Portuguese - Brazil", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497690/27e60b09cfe14d29b57144b5c4b145c36e1cd657/header.jpg?t=1757634342", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497690/435d480dac4854715be8a5b017d0991e5fdf61ef/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757634342", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497690/435d480dac4854715be8a5b017d0991e5fdf61ef/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757634342", "website": "https://www.woodworkgames.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel(R) Core(TM) i3-4170 CPU @ 3.70GHz 3.70 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 6 GB de RAM MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GTX 750 Ti<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-8600 @ 3.10GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GTX 1050 Ti<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</str